# Pattern Pair 5: Task Assignment and Role Accumulation

**The Proximity Task → The Designed Task**

*Derived from: HEI-2 — Three faculty managers with the same title holding three entirely different role profiles — including maintenance of laboratory equipment and management of regulatory waste streams — determined by historical proximity rather than designed scope.*

[← Back to the pattern catalogue](index.md)

